{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"西番雅书","commonName":"西番雅书","title":"西番雅书","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"fc1196cb65315a28a092f977ca923fa3326df17ab28ce5e53635179f429191aa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":51},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亚们的儿子犹大王约西亚执政期间，耶和华的话传给了希西迦的玄孙、亚玛利亚的曾孙、基大利的孙子、古示的儿子西番雅。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华审判的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我必毁灭地上的一切。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必毁灭人类、兽类、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天上的鸟和海里的鱼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使恶人倒毙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必铲除地上的人类。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"“我必伸手攻击犹大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻击耶路撒冷的所有居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清除巴力的残迹及拜偶像之祭司的名号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必铲除那些在屋顶祭拜天上万象的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铲除敬拜耶和华并凭祂起誓又凭米勒公起誓的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铲除离弃耶和华、不寻求祂、不求问祂的人。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"要在主耶和华面前肃静，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的日子近了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已准备好祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洁净了祂邀请的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“在给耶和华献祭之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必惩罚首领和王子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及所有穿外族服装的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，我必惩罚所有跳过门槛","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使主人的家充满暴力和欺诈的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，鱼门必传出哭喊声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新区必响起哀号声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山陵必发出崩裂的巨响。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"市场区的居民啊，哀哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为所有的商人必灭亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有做买卖的必被铲除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，我必提着灯巡察耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惩罚那些安于罪中的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们心想，‘耶和华不赐福也不降祸。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的财物必遭抢掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家园必沦为废墟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们建造房屋，却不能住在里面；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽种葡萄园，却喝不到葡萄酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华的大日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"近了，很快就到了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那将是痛苦的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士也必凄声哀号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是降烈怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是困苦艰难的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是摧残毁坏的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是黑暗幽冥的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是阴霾密布的日子，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是吹号呐喊、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打坚城高垒的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“我要使灾难临到人类，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他们行路像瞎眼的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们得罪了耶和华。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的血必如灰尘般被倒出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的尸体必如粪便般被丢弃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在耶和华发怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的金银救不了他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的怒火必吞噬大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必骤然毁灭一切世人。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“跳过门槛……的人”指祭拜偶像的人，参见撒母耳记上5:5。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEP/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}